WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.403 --> 00:00:18.024
passed as Vinnie and Mandy rode along the trail with the cowboys and cattle.

2
00:00:19.205 --> 00:00:22.265
But then, another group of cowboys approached.

3
00:00:23.506 --> 00:00:28.487
As they passed each other, the cowboys nodded silently to one another.

4
00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:34.041
Some said a simple "Howdy," but none of them waved.

5
00:00:34.061 --> 00:00:40.223
"Those cowboys are dressed differently," remarked Mandy to Cookie.

6
00:00:40.243 --> 00:00:43.845
"They are Spanish cowboys from California.

7
00:00:44.825 --> 00:00:49.087
They know horses better than anyone in the West," explained Cookie.

8
00:00:49.107 --> 00:00:53.128
"On this trail, we meet cowboys from all over."

9
00:00:53.149 --> 00:00:56.310
"Why don't you wave at each other?"

10
00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.151
Vinnie asked Frank.

11
00:00:59.251 --> 00:01:01.352
They were riding next to Cookie's wagon.

12
00:01:02.472 --> 00:01:05.073
"That's a cowboy rule," said Frank.

13
00:01:05.093 --> 00:01:10.614
"You see, if we raise our hand, the horses might get scared.

14
00:01:11.454 --> 00:01:12.755
So we nod instead."

15
00:01:12.775 --> 00:01:16.156
"What other cowboy rules are there?"

16
00:01:16.736 --> 00:01:17.416
asked Vinnie.

17
00:01:18.436 --> 00:01:19.877
Frank thought for a moment.

18
00:01:21.437 --> 00:01:23.538
"We don't ride another man's horse.

19
00:01:24.778 --> 00:01:27.459
And we never wear another cowboy's hat."

20
00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:31.320
The cowboys continued along the trail.

21
00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:37.083
Vinnie was beginning to get bored when his horse began to whinny.

22
00:01:38.263 --> 00:01:41.665
Other horses shook their heads and snorted nervously.

23
00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:44.027
"What's the matter?"

24
00:01:44.507 --> 00:01:45.207
asked Vinnie.

25
00:01:45.227 --> 00:01:49.530
"Something or someone is coming," said Frank.

26
00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.832
He put a hand on his gun and looked around.

27
00:01:55.153 --> 00:01:57.814
Suddenly, six men on horses appeared.

28
00:01:59.035 --> 00:02:02.569
Vinnie could tell immediately that they were not cowboys.

29
00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:07.590
"It's a Cherokee hunting party," explained Frank.

30
00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:12.011
The cowboys lined up their horses in front of the cattle.

31
00:02:13.271 --> 00:02:14.572
They pulled out their guns.

32
00:02:16.272 --> 00:02:18.833
The Cherokee slowed down and stopped.

33
00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:22.934
Their leader called out, "We come in peace."

34
00:02:24.194 --> 00:02:25.335
"What can we do for you?"

35
00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:29.376
asked Frank, motioning his men to put down their guns.

36
00:02:30.864 --> 00:02:35.167
Mandy noticed that the Cherokee dressed differently from the Iroquois.

37
00:02:36.468 --> 00:02:39.970
Vinnie and Mandy had met the Iroquois on an earlier trip.

38
00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:46.515
"We wish to speak with you," said the Cherokee man, getting off his horse.

39
00:02:47.936 --> 00:02:50.697
Frank and another cowboy went to speak with him.

40
00:02:52.619 --> 00:02:55.241
Vinnie noticed a young boy in the hunting party.

41
00:02:56.261 --> 00:03:00.144
Vinnie got off his horse and smiled at the boy.

42
00:03:01.088 --> 00:03:02.710
"Hello," Vinnie said.

43
00:03:02.730 --> 00:03:06.693
"Hello," the boy answered without smiling.

44
00:03:07.994 --> 00:03:09.475
Vinnie introduced himself.

45
00:03:10.736 --> 00:03:14.900
The Cherokee boy, still on his horse, moved closer to Vinnie.

46
00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:21.045
"Tell your father to give us some of his cattle," he said in a threatening voice.

47
00:03:21.065 --> 00:03:23.467
"Who? Frank?

48
00:03:23.908 --> 00:03:26.069
He's not my father," Vinnie said.

49
00:03:26.089 --> 00:03:28.892
"And why should he give you anything?"

50
00:03:30.148 --> 00:03:33.650
Still on his horse, the boy circled Vinnie slowly.

51
00:03:36.232 --> 00:03:37.532
Vinnie felt frightened.

52
00:03:37.552 --> 00:03:43.756
"Your people have taken everything from us," he said angrily.

53
00:03:43.776 --> 00:03:47.758
"Those animals belong to the people of this land.

54
00:03:48.939 --> 00:03:49.679
That's us!"

55
00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:53.862
Vinnie thought about Magua, his Mohawk friend.

56
00:03:55.103 --> 00:03:57.384
His people were angry with whites too.

57
00:03:59.024 --> 00:04:00.926
Vinnie did not know what to say.

58
00:04:00.946 --> 00:04:05.190
"And besides," continued the Cherokee boy.

59
00:04:05.210 --> 00:04:09.894
"If you don't give us cattle, we will attack.

60
00:04:10.875 --> 00:04:12.016
We will kill all of you."
